{"id":"6a611d8e49980c6f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NFresh.md","title":"NFresh","display":"NFresh","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"NFresh","parameters":["x","s","t","z"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"NFresh"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>x</span><span>s</span><span>t</span><span>z</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命名项与开放等式。有序参数：<code>x</code>、<code>s</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>z</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ NFresh x s t z)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ Nat z)\n  (and\n    (not (= z x))\n    (and\n      (not (@ NName z s))\n      (and (not (@ NName z t)) (forall i (implies (in i z) (or (= i x) (or (@ NName i s) (@ NName i t)))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97d55dcf5ea1bb3d\" href=\"?note=97d55dcf5ea1bb3d\" title=\"ZFC_NName\">NName</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ NFresh x s t z)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NName","status":"resolved","id":"97d55dcf5ea1bb3d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_NName|NName]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nat","status":"resolved","id":"e2136a636857d477","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_NName|NName]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":923,"backlinks":[{"id":"164f10d6a348b7a4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NFresh|NFresh]]"},{"id":"eabebd7c57eafb5b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_NApp|NApp]]；[[ZFC_NFree|NFree]]；[[ZFC_NFresh|NFresh]]；[[ZFC_NLam|NLam]]；[[ZFC_NRaw|NRaw]]；[[ZFC_NVar|NVar]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-464","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_NFresh|NFresh]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","97d55dcf5ea1bb3d","e2136a636857d477","593f9bdab4d60707"]}